 "Comment": {
  "type": "cexostring",
  "value": "Combat Dummy - roadmap combat-dummy. Place anywhere from the toolset; it self-installs at OnSpawn (cbd_spawn). Hostile so hostile-only spells can target it; immobile. MUST NOT be Plot: the engine zeroes damage to a plot creature BEFORE the NWNX damage event, so cbd_damage would measure nothing. Indestructibility comes from cbd_damage zeroing the damage after counting it, plus the death immunity in cbd_spawn."
